    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game requires a third-party AI service to play!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Interrogation Simulator is an exciting new game where you will solve fascinating crimes with only your conversation skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will dive into specific cases, interviewing the available suspects for each case and then finally issuing your findings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suspect will be powered by a Large Language Model (LLM) such as those provided by OpenAI (e.g., GPT), Anthropic (e.g., Claude) or a local model (e.g., Llama). By connecting your own AI to the game, you will  experience an AI-powered video game with unprecedented power and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get to create your own investigators, and switch between them freely. Consider how the suspects may respond to different types of characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you catch the real villains, or let them walk free? Only time will tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game requires a third-party AI service to play!!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game requires a third-party AI service to play!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Interrogation Simulator is an exciting new game where you will solve fascinating crimes with only your conversation skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will dive into specific cases, interviewing the available suspects for each case and then finally issuing your findings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suspect will be powered by a Large Language Model (LLM) such as those provided by OpenAI (e.g., GPT), Anthropic (e.g., Claude) or a local model (e.g., Llama). By connecting your own AI to the game, you will  experience an AI-powered video game with unprecedented power and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get to create your own investigators, and switch between them freely. Consider how the suspects may respond to different types of characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you catch the real villains, or let them walk free? Only time will tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game requires a third-party AI service to play!!</strong></p>",
